{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get in touch, check contraindications, or try a short guided exercise to feel the tone before you book.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--muted:#9aa6b2;--accent:#8bd3c7;--accent-2:#6bb7ff;--glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --maxw:1100px;--radius:14px;--gap:22px; font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(1000px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(107,183,255,0.06), transparent 8%), radial-gradient(800px 480px at 95% 90%, rgba(139,211,199,0.04), transparent 10%), #071018; color:#e6f0f2; line-height:1.45}
    header{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo svg{width:44px;height:44px}
    nav{margin-left:auto}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent);}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:24px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
    .contact-card{padding:20px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(75,78,82,0.12), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 6px}
    form input, form textarea, form select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    button.btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border:none;color:#04202a;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}
    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:40px auto 80px;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px) scale(.995);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    /* respects user reduced motion */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    /* Try it modal styles */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3,6,10,0.6), rgba(2,4,6,0.8));display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px;z-index:60}
    .modal-backdrop.open{display:flex}
    .modal{width:720px;max-width:calc(100% - 40px);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:16px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.7);}
    .modal h2{margin:0 0 8px}
    .steps{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .step-btn{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .step-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#04202a}
    .circle-visual{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#04202a;font-weight:700;font-size:22px;margin:18px auto}

    /* form feedback */
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    /* pattern strip referencing the SVG asset */
    .pattern-strip{height:86px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat-x;background-size:auto 86px;border-radius:10px;margin:22px 0}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
      nav{margin-left:0}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="2" y="2" width="44" height="44" rx="10" fill="#071823"/>
        <g fill="none" stroke="#8bd3c7" stroke-width="1.6">
          <path d="M8 34c8-12 32-12 36-8" opacity="0.9"/>
          <path d="M8 28c10-8 28-8 36-4" opacity="0.7"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="events.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="active">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="panel reveal" id="intro">
        <h1>Reach out, confirm details, or try a brief alignment</h1>
        <p class="lead">Use this page to ask questions, share considerations ahead of a booking, or explore a short guided exercise to sample a moment of guided stillness.</p>

        <div class="pattern-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <form id="contactForm">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First &amp; last" required>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>

            <label for="topic">Reason for reaching out</label>
            <select id="topic" name="topic">
              <option>Question about an upcoming event</option>
              <option>Private session inquiry</option>
              <option>Accessibility / contraindications</option>
              <option>Press or partnership</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us anything that helps: mobility, sensitivity, scheduling"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button class="ghost" type="button" id="callBtn">Call {{PHONE}}</button>
              <button class="ghost" type="button" id="tryBtn">Try it now</button>
            </div>
            <div class="note">Or email directly: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </form>

          <div class="meta">Hours: Tue–Sun, various sessions. We generally reply within 48 hours. If this is urgent, call the number above.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel reveal" id="care">
        <h2>Contraindications & guidance</h2>
        <p class="lead">Sound sessions are gentle but not without contraindications. If any of the following apply to you, please contact us before booking so we can make an informed plan:</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
          <li>Pregnancy beyond the first trimester — please discuss specifics.</li>
          <li>Epilepsy or photosensitive conditions (some visual elements can be adapted).</li>
          <li>Recent surgery, implanted medical devices, or severe vestibular disorders.</li>
          <li>Severe psychiatric conditions that require clinical support — we encourage coordination with your care team.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="note">If in doubt, choose a private pre-session call so we can tailor the experience safely for you.</p>

        <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);margin:14px 0">

        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-direction:column">
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a prep call</a>
          <a class="ghost" href="faq.html">Read FAQ on safety</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="panel reveal" id="office" style="margin-top:22px;">
      <h3>Studio & contact</h3>
      <p class="lead">We host group gatherings and private sessions in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. For local partners and press, use the message form above.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px">
          <strong>Email</strong>
          <div class="note"><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px">
          <strong>Phone</strong>
          <div class="note">{{PHONE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px">
          <strong>Book</strong>
          <div class="note"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — Gentle sound gatherings and private attention.</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">To change contact details edit this page's placeholders.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Try-it Modal -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <h2 id="modalTitle">Try a short alignment</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">A compact sequence to center breath, journal, or set an intention. No audio required — purely guided visuals and timing.</p>

      <div class="steps" role="tablist" aria-label="exercise tabs">
        <button class="step-btn active" data-step="breathe">Breathing</button>
        <button class="step-btn" data-step="journal">Journaling</button>
        <button class="step-btn" data-step="intend">Intention</button>
      </div>

      <div id="stepArea">
        <!-- breathe -->
        <div data-panel="breathe">
          <div class="circle-visual" id="breathCircle">3</div>
          <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">Follow the circle: inhale with the growth, exhale as it shrinks. 3 rounds.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px">
            <button class="btn" id="startBreath">Start</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="skipBreath">Skip</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- journal -->
        <div data-panel="journal" hidden>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">A two-minute prompted write. Note without judgment.</p>
          <textarea id="journalText" rows="6" placeholder="What are you leaving behind? What would you bring forward? (2 minutes)"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="startJournal">Start 2:00</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="clearJournal">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="journalTimer" style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- intention -->
        <div data-panel="intend" hidden>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Set a short phrase you can carry into the rest of your day. We offer options or type your own.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="step-btn" data-intent="Open to calm">Open to calm</button>
            <button class="step-btn" data-intent="Receive what serves">Receive what serves</button>
            <button class="step-btn" data-intent="Gentle attention">Gentle attention</button>
          </div>
          <label style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">My phrase</label>
          <input id="intentInput" placeholder="Type an intention or pick one above">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:12px">
            <button class="btn" id="saveIntent">Save & close</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="cancelIntent">Cancel</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with reduced motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }
      const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      reveals.forEach(el=>obs.observe(el));
    })();

    // Contact form handling (local demo)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = this.name.value.trim() || '—';
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. Your message has been captured locally for this demo. Please replace this with your form backend or mailto flow.');
      this.reset();
    });
    document.getElementById('callBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      window.location.href = 'tel:' + '{{PHONE}}';
    });

    // Modal logic and guided exercises
    const modalRoot = document.getElementById('modal');
    const tryBtn = document.getElementById('tryBtn');
    const stepBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.step-btn[data-step]'));
    const panels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]'));
    const modalTitle = document.getElementById('modalTitle');

    function openModal(){ modalRoot.classList.add('open'); modalRoot.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); document.body.style.overflow='hidden'; }
    function closeModal(){ modalRoot.classList.remove('open'); modalRoot.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); document.body.style.overflow=''; }

    tryBtn.addEventListener('click', openModal);
    modalRoot.addEventListener('click', (ev)=>{ if(ev.target === modalRoot) closeModal(); });

    stepBtns.forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        stepBtns.forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        const step = btn.getAttribute('data-step');
        panels.forEach(p=>{ p.hidden = p.getAttribute('data-panel') !== step; });
      });
    });

    // Breathing pattern: 3 rounds of 4s inhale, 6s exhale (simple timing)
    const breathCircle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
    const startBreath = document.getElementById('startBreath');
    const skipBreath = document.getElementById('skipBreath');
    let breathTimer;
    startBreath.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      let round = 0; const total = 3;
      startBreath.disabled = true; skipBreath.disabled = false;
      const run = ()=>{
        if(round >= total){ finishBreath(); return; }
        round++;
        // visual countdown: expand 4s, hold .5s, shrink 6s
        breathCircle.textContent = 'In';
        breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 4s ease';
        breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(1.35)';
        breathTimer = setTimeout(()=>{
          breathCircle.textContent = 'Out';
          breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 6s ease';
          breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(.9)';
          breathTimer = setTimeout(()=>{
            breathCircle.style.transition = '';
            breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(1)';
            setTimeout(run, 500);
          }, 6000);
        }, 4000);
      };
      run();
    });
    function finishBreath(){
      clearTimeout(breathTimer); startBreath.disabled=false; skipBreath.disabled=false; breathCircle.textContent='Done';
      setTimeout(()=>{ closeModal(); }, 750);
    }
    skipBreath.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ finishBreath(); });

    // Journal timer
    const journalText = document.getElementById('journalText');
    const startJournal = document.getElementById('startJournal');
    const journalTimerEl = document.getElementById('journalTimer');
    let journalInterval;
    startJournal.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      let remaining = 120; // seconds
      startJournal.disabled = true;
      journalTimerEl.textContent = formatTime(remaining);
      journalInterval = setInterval(()=>{
        remaining--; journalTimerEl.textContent = formatTime(remaining);
        if(remaining <= 0){ clearInterval(journalInterval); startJournal.disabled=false; journalTimerEl.textContent='Complete'; }
      },1000);
    });
    document.getElementById('clearJournal').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ journalText.value=''; });
    function formatTime(s){ const m=Math.floor(s/60); const sec = s%60; return m+':' + String(sec).padStart(2,'0'); }

    // Intention buttons
    Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-intent]')).forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ document.getElementById('intentInput').value = b.getAttribute('data-intent'); });
    });
    document.getElementById('saveIntent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const val = document.getElementById('intentInput').value.trim();
      if(val) alert('Saved intention: "' + val + '" — carry it with you.');
      closeModal();
    });
    document.getElementById('cancelIntent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ closeModal(); });

    // keyboard escape
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape'){ closeModal(); } });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# contact.html — Connect page for sound_bath

This chunk contains two files: contact.html and this README.md. The contact page is built for the sound bath events site and implements the following features locally (no external assets required):

- A contact form (demo, client-side only) with placeholders:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

- A "Try it now" guided exercise modal that runs entirely in client-side JavaScript. It includes three micro-practices:
  - Breathing: visual circle with timed inhale/exhale cycles.
  - Journaling: 2-minute prompt and live countdown.
  - Intention: quick pick or custom phrase save.

- Scroll-triggered section reveal using IntersectionObserver, with proper respect for the user's prefers-reduced-motion setting (if reduced motion is preferred, reveal animations are disabled and content becomes visible immediately).

- Contraindications section responsibly listed, encouraging contact or private pre-session calls when relevant.

- Visual styling is self-contained CSS; the page references an SVG pattern at `assets/img/pattern.svg` for decorative striping. The actual asset should be placed at that path by the build system (this chunk does not include the SVG file). Ensure a unique SVG is used there as required by the project brief.

Notes for integration and testing:

- The contact form only shows a client-side alert to simulate message submission. Replace the form submit handler with your backend endpoint or a mailto link as needed.
- The phone button uses a `tel:` link built with the {{PHONE}} placeholder.
- The modal is accessible: it can be closed with Escape or by clicking the backdrop; `aria-hidden` toggles are present for basic screen reader signaling. For production, consider managing focus trapping inside the modal for improved accessibility.
- The reveal animation respects `prefers-reduced-motion` and will immediately show content when reduced motion is enabled.

Placeholders must be replaced with real values as part of templating or a build step.

If you need the pattern SVG created or this page adapted to a different layout family, tell me which variations are needed and I will update the code."}
BUNDLE_END
